    "noteZh": "About 栏写着 Accessibility audit for chart color palettes: WCAG non-text contrast, Machado 2009 CVD simulation, OKLab dE separation. One engine, four faces: API, CLI, CI gate, MCP server.，标了 MIT license、0 stars，Contributors 里除了 socraticstatic 还挂着 claude。README 从 Four ways in. Pick yours. 分成四节：1 · Try a palette (nothing to install)、2 · Gate your CI、3 · Call it from code、4 · Wire it into an agent (MCP)，另有 Floors、Honest scope、Where this came from、Consulting；文件列表里 server.json、tsup.config.ts、vitest.config.ts 说明它同时是 npm 包和 MCP server。",
